[gd_scene format=3]

; One variable: CameraAttributesPractical.exposure_multiplier = 2, on a WorldEnvironment that names no
; Environment, over the bake of `unit-lightmap-gi-baked`. The bake ran at exposure 1, so Godot reads
; its atlas at 2 over 1, and the Static sun, which lights nothing in real time, brightens with it.
; The clear colour is no Environment's background, so it stays. No other scene reads a lightmap under
; an exposure, so none shows a wrong baked-exposure division.

